{title: Sukoon Mila}
{artist: Arijit Singh}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Mila hoon ab jo [A]tum se,        Hai [F#m]dil ko mere [Bm]kasam se
Sukoon [D]mila, sukoon [Bm]mila,        [D]Tujhe hai paaya [A]rab se
Hai [F#m]dil ko mere [Bm]kasam se,        [D]Sukoon mila, [Bm]sukoon mila
Har [D]pal haseen sa [A]huaa hai,        [D]Saanson ko tune [A]chhuaa hai
Badhi [Bm]tujhse nazdee [D]kiyaan,        Sukoon [A]mila sukun [Bm]mila... [A]
[D]Mila hoon ab jo [A]tum se,        Hai [F#m]dil ko mere [Bm]kasam se
Sukoon [D]mila sukun [Bm]mila [E] ... [A],        Jab se [C#m]juda tujhse [F#m]jiya
Chain aur [Bm]qaraar dil ko [A]mila,        Jab se [C#m]juda tujhse [F#m]jiya
Chain aur [Bm]qaraar dil ko [A]mila,        Jab bhi [C#m]rahoon sang [F#m]tere
Bhoolun har [Bm]gham shiqwa [A]gila,        Tere [D]ishq ka hi [A]nasha hai
Meri [D]rooh tak mein [A]basaa hai,        Tune [Bm]aankhon se jo [D]chhuaa
Sukoon [A]mila, sukoon [Bm]mila... [A],        [D]Mila hoon ab jo [A]tum se
Hai [F#m]dil ko mere [D]kasam se,        Sukoon [Bm]mila... [E] .. [A]
